@base = http://localhost:3000/api
@json = application/json

### All cars -> 200
GET {{base}}/cars

### One car -> 200
GET {{base}}/cars/c1

### Unknown id -> 404
GET {{base}}/cars/c99

### All motorcycles -> 200
GET {{base}}/motorcycles

### Create a car -> 201 + Location
POST {{base}}/cars
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "arrival_date": "2024-01-15",
  "make": "Toyota",
  "model": "Corolla",
  "year": 2020,
  "mileage": 40000,
  "price": { "currency": "EUR", "value": 17500 },
  "engine": { "type": "Petrol", "horsepower": 120, "displacement": 1.8 },
  "color": "White",
  "doors": 4
}

### Invalid car -> 400 with details per field
POST {{base}}/cars
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ "make": "", "year": 1800, "price": { "currency": "EUR", "value": -5 } }

### Replace c3 (created above) -> 200
PUT {{base}}/cars/c3
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "arrival_date": "2024-01-15",
  "make": "Toyota",
  "model": "Corolla",
  "year": 2020,
  "mileage": 40000,
  "price": { "currency": "EUR", "value": 17500 },
  "engine": { "type": "Petrol", "horsepower": 120, "displacement": 1.8 },
  "color": "Red",
  "doors": 4
}

### Delete c3 -> 204 (run again -> 404)
DELETE {{base}}/cars/c3

### Not JSON body -> 415
POST {{base}}/cars
Content-Type: text/plain

hello

### Client wants XML -> 406
GET {{base}}/cars
Accept: application/xml

### Malformed JSON -> 400
POST {{base}}/cars
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ bad
